The paper’s central distinction is **accounting without equivalence**:

- visibility without fungibility;
- recognition without sale;
- obligation without permanent debt;
- access through governance rather than price;
- repair rather than monetary settlement.

It draws on Marx, Mauss, Polanyi, Graeber, and Ostrom while extending them through the Semantic Economy framework.

